## Build

The project needs [pixi](https://pixi.sh), a TeX distribution for the pdfs
(`quarto install tinytex` serves), and, for track-changes diffs,
[typst-diff](https://github.com/alexanderkoller/typst-diff)
(`cargo install --locked --git https://github.com/alexanderkoller/typst-diff typst-diff`).
`pixi.toml` and `pixi.lock` supply the rest: Python, Quarto, the formats'
Python package, and qdiff.

| Task | Does |
|---|---|
| `pixi run init` | once: copies the paper and deck starters into `paper/` and `slides/`, with their formats |
| `pixi run render` | the working-paper pdf, `paper/paper.pdf` |
| `pixi run html` | the working-paper html; `pixi run preview` re-renders it on save |
| `pixi run blind` | the blinded manuscript, `paper/blind.pdf` |
| `pixi run titlepage` | the separate title page, `paper/title-page.pdf` |
| `pixi run submit` | both, then the journal bundle in `paper/submission/`, checked for identity leaks |
| `pixi run diff OLD [NEW]` | the track-changes pdf from OLD to NEW, each a git ref or a directory; NEW defaults to the working tree |
| `pixi run tables` | every table formatter in `analysis/tables/`; the renders run it first |
| `pixi run slides` | the deck |
| `pixi run formats` | reinstalls every format at its pin; `pixi run versions` lists them |

`pixi task list` shows every task.

## Layout

```
data/              the data (git-ignored)
notebooks/         exploratory work
src/{{ package }}/   the project's code, installed editable
analysis/          the run scripts; each writes raw output to results/
analysis/tables/   the formatters; each reads results/ and writes a table for the paper
results/           the raw outputs (CSV)
paper/             the manuscript: paper.qmd, _quarto.yml (title, abstract, authorship),
                   _quarto-blind.yml (the submission profile), title-page.qmd
slides/            the talk: slides.qmd
```

## Updating

- **A format.** Change its tag in `pixi.toml`'s `[activation.env]` (for
  `ssus_papers`, also `ssus-papers`' tag, the same release), run
  `pixi run formats` and `pixi install`, and commit the installed
  `_extensions/` with the pin.
- **The layout.** `pixi exec copier update` merges the template's later
  changes to these files with the project's own; the working tree must be
  committed first.
